(7496149, 1194380, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great color. The buildings don''t look sharp, like you had some camera movement during the exposure.</td>', 'Great color. The buildings don''t look sharp, like you had some camera movement during the exposure.', '2017-02-01 11:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496152, 1194629, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what is supposed to be the subject here. Is it the person (who it looks like is a bit blurry) or the rock structure? If it''s the later, the person detracts from that.</td>', 'I''m not sure what is supposed to be the subject here. Is it the person (who it looks like is a bit blurry) or the rock structure? If it''s the later, the person detracts from that.', '2017-02-01 11:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496153, 1193828, 114225, '<td valign="top">Woah, that is just lovely. It''s great how the fallen snow is undistrubed. And the light is amazing.</td>', 'Woah, that is just lovely. It''s great how the fallen snow is undistrubed. And the light is amazing.', '2017-02-01 11:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496154, 1194378, 114225, '<td valign="top">Your horizon is tilted, making this photo feel off.</td>', 'Your horizon is tilted, making this photo feel off.', '2017-02-01 11:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
