(7496286, 1194593, 156466, '<td valign="top">Overblown sun is a tick off the score but I really like this. I''d like it more if the title was something like, "And then he was gone" or "And then she flew". Love the mystery of the lost footsteps.</td>', 'Overblown sun is a tick off the score but I really like this. I''d like it more if the title was something like, "And then he was gone" or "And then she flew". Love the mystery of the lost footsteps.', '2017-02-01 16:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496287, 1194490, 156466, '<td valign="top">And for that challenge this would have worked. Here, the processing makes the girl a distraction (not to say that the processing is bad). If she was actively going somewhere perhaps, but in the squat she''s just there and I don''t know why.</td>', 'And for that challenge this would have worked. Here, the processing makes the girl a distraction (not to say that the processing is bad). If she was actively going somewhere perhaps, but in the squat she''s just there and I don''t know why.', '2017-02-01 17:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496288, 1193324, 156466, '<td valign="top">I have so many of these, and I like mine as much as I like yours. And I like mine.</td>', 'I have so many of these, and I like mine as much as I like yours. And I like mine.', '2017-02-01 17:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496290, 1194580, 156466, '<td valign="top">They''re always flying in the wrong direction, aren''t they?</td>', 'They''re always flying in the wrong direction, aren''t they?', '2017-02-01 17:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496291, 1194155, 156466, '<td valign="top">Resist the urge to oversaturate. #Resist</td>', 'Resist the urge to oversaturate. #Resist', '2017-02-01 17:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496292, 1194329, 156466, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell you how much I love this, and it''s not because I don''t.</td>', 'I can''t tell you how much I love this, and it''s not because I don''t.', '2017-02-01 17:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496293, 1194666, 156466, '<td valign="top">It''s so cliche, but for some reason I don''t mind. Nicely processed.</td>', 'It''s so cliche, but for some reason I don''t mind. Nicely processed.', '2017-02-01 17:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496294, 1193954, 156466, '<td valign="top">This made me stop and stare immediately. I''ve got some nits to pick over the red in the sign, but I don''t really care. This is all sorts of good.</td>', 'This made me stop and stare immediately. I''ve got some nits to pick over the red in the sign, but I don''t really care. This is all sorts of good.', '2017-02-01 17:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496295, 1194402, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice take on a familiar theme.</td>', 'Nice take on a familiar theme.', '2017-02-01 17:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496297, 1193471, 156466, '<td valign="top">It''s supposed to be out of place, but it feels out of place in the wrong place compositionally. Really nice, but I want you to pan up a bit (or a lot). The foreground does nothing but take away from what I believe could have been a top 10 shot.</td>', 'It''s supposed to be out of place, but it feels out of place in the wrong place compositionally. Really nice, but I want you to pan up a bit (or a lot). The foreground does nothing but take away from what I believe could have been a top 10 shot.', '2017-02-01 17:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496299, 1194289, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love the shot but the blown out highlights in the middle, not so much.</td>', 'Love the shot but the blown out highlights in the middle, not so much.', '2017-02-01 17:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496300, 1194582, 156466, '<td valign="top">Perhaps (more than) just a tad dark, but lovely otherwise. I love the shot, but not the processing.</td>', 'Perhaps (more than) just a tad dark, but lovely otherwise. I love the shot, but not the processing.', '2017-02-01 17:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496301, 1194502, 156466, '<td valign="top">I need to see more or none of the bloke on the left.</td>', 'I need to see more or none of the bloke on the left.', '2017-02-01 17:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496302, 1194559, 156466, '<td valign="top">Outstanding capture. I understand the desire to keep the interested onlookers and the guy''s horse in the frame, but it takes away from this magical grab. Crop in and this is superb. Just too much other stuff.</td>', 'Outstanding capture. I understand the desire to keep the interested onlookers and the guy''s horse in the frame, but it takes away from this magical grab. Crop in and this is superb. Just too much other stuff.', '2017-02-01 17:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496303, 1193641, 156466, '<td valign="top">Ansel-esque. Not sure about the final processing, but I''ll just say "close to magical".</td>', 'Ansel-esque. Not sure about the final processing, but I''ll just say "close to magical".', '2017-02-01 17:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496304, 1194534, 156466, '<td valign="top">Almost as if you fall off the edge of the planet to the right. Watch that oversharpening. Really distracts.</td>', 'Almost as if you fall off the edge of the planet to the right. Watch that oversharpening. Really distracts.', '2017-02-01 17:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496305, 1194554, 156466, '<td valign="top">I understand why you want this to balance on the center line (I don''t agree, but I''m OK with it). What I don''t understand is why you didn''t take this a few more inches to the right so the symmetry was pure.</td>', 'I understand why you want this to balance on the center line (I don''t agree, but I''m OK with it). What I don''t understand is why you didn''t take this a few more inches to the right so the symmetry was pure.', '2017-02-01 17:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496306, 1194388, 156466, '<td valign="top">Disney-esque. Lovely single capture. A little busy for me, but from a processing point of view this is lovely.</td>', 'Disney-esque. Lovely single capture. A little busy for me, but from a processing point of view this is lovely.', '2017-02-01 17:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496307, 1194407, 156466, '<td valign="top">Pan right a bit, I didn''t see the guy until your title made me look for him.</td>', 'Pan right a bit, I didn''t see the guy until your title made me look for him.', '2017-02-01 17:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496308, 1194507, 156466, '<td valign="top">I so want some sort of line to ground this image - probably a vertical. There is such a great picture in here with the right perspective and focal length.</td>', 'I so want some sort of line to ground this image - probably a vertical. There is such a great picture in here with the right perspective and focal length.', '2017-02-01 17:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496311, 1194567, 156466, '<td valign="top">Bumping this after the first pass. Well seen, well shot, well processed. Ribbon for me.</td>', 'Bumping this after the first pass. Well seen, well shot, well processed. Ribbon for me.', '2017-02-01 17:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496312, 1194695, 156466, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Michael O''Brien''s "Hard Ground" work, though not quite as dark. Great street portrait.</td>', 'Reminds me of Michael O''Brien''s "Hard Ground" work, though not quite as dark. Great street portrait.', '2017-02-01 17:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496313, 1194586, 156466, '<td valign="top">Really not my kind of shot, but technically very well done. I might have dealt with that one dark spot on the left edge in the clouds.</td>', 'Really not my kind of shot, but technically very well done. I might have dealt with that one dark spot on the left edge in the clouds.', '2017-02-01 17:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496314, 1193807, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love the intimate moment</td>', 'Love the intimate moment', '2017-02-01 17:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496317, 1194440, 156466, '<td valign="top">Come on, "I''m Looking Through You" - it''s obvious!! :) <br/> <br/>I love everything but the title. <br/> <br/>(OK, it''s not obvious, "Secondhand Voyeurism" is better. LOL) 7 for me. I want to give it more and would if the verticals were straight. Still expect this could be front page.</td>', 'Come on, "I''m Looking Through You" - it''s obvious!! :)  I love everything but the title.  (OK, it''s not obvious, "Secondhand Voyeurism" is better. LOL) 7 for me. I want to give it more and would if the verticals were straight. Still expect this could be front page.', '2017-02-01 17:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496321, 1194395, 156466, '<td valign="top">I really like this and am bumping it a point. That said, in your processing, when you pull out details in the stuff you want us to see, get rid of it in the stuff you don''t. Too much structure in the OOF areas here.</td>', 'I really like this and am bumping it a point. That said, in your processing, when you pull out details in the stuff you want us to see, get rid of it in the stuff you don''t. Too much structure in the OOF areas here.', '2017-02-01 18:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496371, 1194461, 185714, '<td valign="top">Love the tones &amp; composition.</td>', 'Love the tones & composition.', '2017-02-01 21:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496373, 1194176, 185714, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2017-02-01 21:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496377, 1194509, 182284, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what I did before but I love the bubbles. I gave you a 7. Very nice.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-02-09 09:50:49.</i></td>', 'I don''t know what I did before but I love the bubbles. I gave you a 7. Very nice.', '2017-02-01 21:28:24.000000', '2017-02-09 09:50:49.000000', 1),
