(7496758, 1194559, 163081, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173263" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg"/></a> Wow, what a catch. I like the guys watching in the top right. In my top 3, a 9 from me and my Yellow Dragon Award.<br/>(the saturation is just a little too much to get my 10)</td>', ' Wow, what a catch. I like the guys watching in the top right. In my top 3, a 9 from me and my Yellow Dragon Award.(the saturation is just a little too much to get my 10)', '2017-02-04 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496762, 1194692, 163081, '<td valign="top">Very nice pov. In my top 5 for the FS. An 8 from me</td>', 'Very nice pov. In my top 5 for the FS. An 8 from me', '2017-02-04 00:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496765, 1194671, 163081, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, peaceful and well taken. I am not a big fan of the blueish snow but I must agree that in this picture it really fits with the colours of the sky. In my top 5 and an 8 from me</td>', 'This is lovely, peaceful and well taken. I am not a big fan of the blueish snow but I must agree that in this picture it really fits with the colours of the sky. In my top 5 and an 8 from me', '2017-02-04 00:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496766, 1194491, 24486, '<td valign="top">I entered something similar a few years back. I think this is better. The turn signal lights definitely add a nice element to the composition</td>', 'I entered something similar a few years back. I think this is better. The turn signal lights definitely add a nice element to the composition', '2017-02-04 00:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496768, 1194587, 163081, '<td valign="top">very impressive view of Dubai, those long shadows are giving it a whole new dimension</td>', 'very impressive view of Dubai, those long shadows are giving it a whole new dimension', '2017-02-04 00:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496793, 1194689, 179608, '<td valign="top">number 1 in my opinion</td>', 'number 1 in my opinion', '2017-02-04 07:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496807, 1194553, 53094, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Mr. Scaley is perfect for your B&amp;W conversion.  The detail is pretty amazing. If I could make one suggestion, it would be to try to bring his eye out just a tad more.</td>', 'Very nice! Mr. Scaley is perfect for your B&W conversion.  The detail is pretty amazing. If I could make one suggestion, it would be to try to bring his eye out just a tad more.', '2017-02-04 11:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496811, 1194502, 53094, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo. The actors in the poster appear to be watching the people walking by. Adele seems oblivious, though! Your B&amp;W conversion works well here, too.</td>', 'This is an interesting photo. The actors in the poster appear to be watching the people walking by. Adele seems oblivious, though! Your B&W conversion works well here, too.', '2017-02-04 11:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496812, 1194559, 53094, '<td valign="top">Good stop action photo. I like how you captured the steer wrestler just as his hat was coming off. It must take a lot of guts to jump off a galloping horse onto a steer with a sharp set of horns!</td>', 'Good stop action photo. I like how you captured the steer wrestler just as his hat was coming off. It must take a lot of guts to jump off a galloping horse onto a steer with a sharp set of horns!', '2017-02-04 11:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496814, 1194623, 53094, '<td valign="top">I really like the softness, and motion blur in this. The subdued colors in the snow make this photo appealing to me.</td>', 'I really like the softness, and motion blur in this. The subdued colors in the snow make this photo appealing to me.', '2017-02-04 11:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496815, 1194397, 53094, '<td valign="top">Mushrooms are just so interesting, and they have great texture. The heads remind me of the moon''s surface. The lighting is great with good use of negative space.</td>', 'Mushrooms are just so interesting, and they have great texture. The heads remind me of the moon''s surface. The lighting is great with good use of negative space.', '2017-02-04 11:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496816, 1194512, 53094, '<td valign="top">The vibrant colors really got my attention in this photo. I also like the city scape in the background.</td>', 'The vibrant colors really got my attention in this photo. I also like the city scape in the background.', '2017-02-04 12:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496817, 1194529, 53094, '<td valign="top">Crows are difficult to photograph. The exposure is good, and I like the sharpness of the eye. The bokeh is appealing as well.</td>', 'Crows are difficult to photograph. The exposure is good, and I like the sharpness of the eye. The bokeh is appealing as well.', '2017-02-04 12:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496818, 1193966, 53094, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice, but the tilted horizon and harshness detract from the photo, at least for me.  This same scene taken in the start or end of the day would be more appealing, in my opinion.</td>', 'The colors are nice, but the tilted horizon and harshness detract from the photo, at least for me.  This same scene taken in the start or end of the day would be more appealing, in my opinion.', '2017-02-04 12:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496819, 1194517, 53094, '<td valign="top">It took me a few seconds to see that this photo is flipped upside down. The reflections are nice, and the B&amp;W conversion is well done.</td>', 'It took me a few seconds to see that this photo is flipped upside down. The reflections are nice, and the B&W conversion is well done.', '2017-02-04 12:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496820, 1194388, 53094, '<td valign="top">This is so colorful that I didn''t see the fireworks at first. Beautiful!</td>', 'This is so colorful that I didn''t see the fireworks at first. Beautiful!', '2017-02-04 12:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496826, 1193092, 53094, '<td valign="top">This seems like an obvious attempt at capturing the brown ribbon, so I choose not to vote on it.</td>', 'This seems like an obvious attempt at capturing the brown ribbon, so I choose not to vote on it.', '2017-02-04 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496827, 1194219, 53094, '<td valign="top">This photo is beautiful, and one of my top picks.</td>', 'This photo is beautiful, and one of my top picks.', '2017-02-04 13:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496841, 1194682, 56502, '<td valign="top">I''m glad they speak out.</td>', 'I''m glad they speak out.', '2017-02-04 15:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496854, 1193193, 56502, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit (not much) more of the fence so it''s character of being a unsurmountable barrier is more prominent - still a very, very impressive shot.</td>', 'Maybe a bit (not much) more of the fence so it''s character of being a unsurmountable barrier is more prominent - still a very, very impressive shot.', '2017-02-04 16:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7496855, 1194527, 56502, '<td valign="top">Yes!</td>', 'Yes!', '2017-02-04 16:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
