(7497496, 1194629, 104230, '<td valign="top">For this challenge I am making a point of commenting on a few images which fall in different places on my scoring. This I scored "in the middle". The picture seems well exposed and rock and water make for an interesting combination.  However I find my eye keeps jumping back and forth between the man and the highest point of the outcropping, each close to the edges of the picture. The distant background is tantalizingly hard to interpret and neither it nor the few clouds that show add a great deal.</td>', 'For this challenge I am making a point of commenting on a few images which fall in different places on my scoring. This I scored "in the middle". The picture seems well exposed and rock and water make for an interesting combination.  However I find my eye keeps jumping back and forth between the man and the highest point of the outcropping, each close to the edges of the picture. The distant background is tantalizingly hard to interpret and neither it nor the few clouds that show add a great deal.', '2017-02-07 20:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7497501, 1194282, 104230, '<td valign="top">For this challenge I am making a point of commenting on a few images which fall in different places on my scoring. This was at the low end of my range. The title is an interesting political commentary, but sadly I find the picture does little to capture or hold my interest. Apart from the setting sun the light is very flat and I can''t see any detail. Adjusting brightness and contrast to all but the very brightest areas might have counteracted that.</td>', 'For this challenge I am making a point of commenting on a few images which fall in different places on my scoring. This was at the low end of my range. The title is an interesting political commentary, but sadly I find the picture does little to capture or hold my interest. Apart from the setting sun the light is very flat and I can''t see any detail. Adjusting brightness and contrast to all but the very brightest areas might have counteracted that.', '2017-02-07 20:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
