(7497691, 1194366, 28742, '<td valign="top">Wow - one comment (generally positive) and 111th place? If I had voted, I''d give this a 6. The unfortunate, but not-your-fault issue I would have is the eagle''s pose with the angle of the shot. Can''t see his majestic face that well. And the focus is a little soft. Still an awesome capture, though and deserving of a much better placement, IMO.</td>', 'Wow - one comment (generally positive) and 111th place? If I had voted, I''d give this a 6. The unfortunate, but not-your-fault issue I would have is the eagle''s pose with the angle of the shot. Can''t see his majestic face that well. And the focus is a little soft. Still an awesome capture, though and deserving of a much better placement, IMO.', '2017-02-08 02:50:39.000000', NULL, 0),
