(7497723, 1193632, 2158, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> 7 from me... although the technicals aren''t wonderful... you''ve captured something that moves me.  Well done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It was taken while I was stopped at a red light, using my point and shoot. The photos from that camera are rarely technically good and this one actually came out better than I''d hoped.</td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: 7 from me... although the technicals aren''t wonderful... you''ve captured something that moves me.  Well done.   It was taken while I was stopped at a red light, using my point and shoot. The photos from that camera are rarely technically good and this one actually came out better than I''d hoped.', '2017-02-08 06:26:46.000000', NULL, 0),
