(7497742, 1194329, 54446, '<td valign="top">Animal in captivity.  Do you pass off captive animals as wild?  I think so!  Oh, it''s a good action photo, with all the water splashing around.  Congratulations on your blue ribbon.  But, it is an exploitation of a caged animal that cannot flee.  And, you are concealing any evidence of confinement.  (I didn''t vote in this challenge because of this image.)</td>', 'Animal in captivity.  Do you pass off captive animals as wild?  I think so!  Oh, it''s a good action photo, with all the water splashing around.  Congratulations on your blue ribbon.  But, it is an exploitation of a caged animal that cannot flee.  And, you are concealing any evidence of confinement.  (I didn''t vote in this challenge because of this image.)', '2017-02-08 09:03:10.000000', NULL, 0),
