(7497822, 1194623, 86447, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 5, Wendy, so I''m part of the crowd.<br/> <br/>I think if the eye and maybe also the beak were really sharp and with a catchlight (even an artificial one)... it would have scored higher.</td>', 'I gave it a 5, Wendy, so I''m part of the crowd. I think if the eye and maybe also the beak were really sharp and with a catchlight (even an artificial one)... it would have scored higher.', '2017-02-08 17:41:53.000000', NULL, 0),
