(7497839, 1194623, 30049, '<td valign="top">Didn''t vote (sorry) ... my observation at this point would be the softness.  Looks like missed focus (attempted to get the head in focus but missed).  I probably would have given this a 4.  Hope that doesn''t sound mean.  Just being honest.</td>', 'Didn''t vote (sorry) ... my observation at this point would be the softness.  Looks like missed focus (attempted to get the head in focus but missed).  I probably would have given this a 4.  Hope that doesn''t sound mean.  Just being honest.', '2017-02-08 20:07:43.000000', NULL, 0),
